 or arbitrary policy statement list." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="50.00" y="760.00" width="1850.00" height="110.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No resources; container instance disabled and IAM policy statements empty. Exactly two resource declarations.&lt;br&gt;Containers, VNIC, volumes, DNS, health checks and image-pull settings are nested instance blocks, not independently managed cloud resources here.&lt;br&gt;Private/public reachability depends on the existing subnet and rules. Resource-principal disabling defaults false per container; access still requires actual reviewed IAM." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1150.00" width="2460.00" height="135.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="containers / creation-time nested specifications" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n16" target="n6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="vnics / supplied network identifiers" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.51111111;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n18"><mxGeometry relative="1" a